## Advisory Services
We offer advisory services whereby we will consider your personal and financial circumstances to advise you on your financial needs.
We are a whole of market, independent financial services firm providing advisory services that includes a range of investment solutions, including retirement planning, estate planning and financial protection.
We will also consider and, where appropriate, recommend suitable personal protection cover for you . We offer products from a range of insurers or all non-investment insurance products which include term assurance, critical illness, private medical insurance, permanent health insurance, and accident and sickness and unemployment insurance.
As part of this service, we work with third party underwriters who will assist with obtaining and finalising a quotation.
We will provide you with a suitability report which will explain our recommendations and why we consider it is suitable for your needs. Our advice will be independent or whole of market unless the suitability letter explains any limitation or restriction on the advice provided.  Only once you have confirmed your instructions will we proceed with implementing our recommendations .
